Analyses and figure generation were performed in R using publicly available packages and established computational workflows.
Standard preprocessing steps (Seurat-based QC filtering, scDblFinder, normalization (SCTransform), dimensionality reduction, clustering, and differential expression) followed widely used published tutorials.
Figure-specific analyses are summarized below.

